# Engine Pipeline

The Trading Intelligence Engine processes market data through a sequence of independent intelligence engines.

```
Yahoo Finance
      │
      ▼
Normalizer
      │
      ▼
Validator
      │
      ▼
Swing Engine
      │
      ▼
Market Structure
      │
      ▼
Structure Analysis
      │
      ▼
Break of Structure (BOS)
      │
      ▼
Change of Character (CHOCH)
      │
      ▼
Trend Engine
      │
      ▼
Structural Levels
      │
      ▼
Structural Strength
      │
      ▼
Liquidity (Future)
      │
      ▼
Supply & Demand (Future)
      │
      ▼
Order Blocks (Future)
      │
      ▼
Fair Value Gaps (Future)
      │
      ▼
Decision Engine
```

## Pipeline Philosophy

Each engine:

- performs one responsibility
- receives immutable input
- returns immutable output
- never modifies previous stages
- can be tested independently